        "title": "The diagram below illustrates the process of producing drinking water using a solar-powered water pump and water filter.  Summarize the information and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The diagram below illustrates the process of producing drinking water using a solar-powered water pump and water filter. </strong></em></span><em style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Summarize the information and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">IELTS Writing Task 1 - Drinking Water Production with Solar Power</p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-VteedxXD9o1giPxMwgplbqBngsp\">Đề b&agrave;i Drinking Water Production with Solar Power y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất nước uống bằng m&aacute;y bơm nước v&agrave; bộ lọc nước sử dụng năng lượng mặt trời.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-StR3d6EVgoRfGgx1yHAlizUJgpf\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Drinking Water Production with Solar Power với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất nước uống bằng hệ thống bơm v&agrave;&nbsp;<strong>lọc nước</strong><em><strong> </strong></em><em>(filtration system)</em> sử dụng <strong>năng lượng mặt trời</strong><em> (solar-powered).</em></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-URUgdOFlfoTLuOx4fhol6qV1gQ3\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UKHSdWxxroNK7Nx2f1zl4qLggqe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UZJkdyc95oLKQRxnT9OlqVvPgZd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề Process, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh đưa ra c&aacute;i nh&igrave;n tổng quan về <strong>những bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất nước: </strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OufXdpJqroQUOgxWDvtlinKVggb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất nước <strong>bền vững</strong> <em>(sustainable)</em>, <strong>tận dụng năng lượng mặt trời</strong><em> (utilizes solar energy)</em> để khai th&aacute;c <strong>nước ngầm</strong> <em>(groundwater) </em>v&agrave; sau đ&oacute;<strong> lọc sạch</strong><em> (purify)</em> th&ocirc;ng qua<strong> hệ thống lọc</strong> <em>(filtration). </em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MZu4d3DEHo2BTfx3Hh1lfhGFgPf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Hệ thống hoạt động qua hai giai đoạn ch&iacute;nh: <strong>chuyển đổi năng lượng</strong> <em>(energy conversion)</em> v&agrave; bơm nước, tiếp theo l&agrave; xử l&yacute; v&agrave; <strong>ph&acirc;n phối </strong><em>(distribution)</em> nước.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fo2sd3zeAodp8xxc5jCl4J6UgSg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>chia c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh th&agrave;nh 2 phần</strong>:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fo2sd3zeAodp8xxc5jCl4J6UgSg\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WN3qdbyTAoOopkxv6L1lsa0CgGL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1: Những bước đầu trong qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh sản xuất nước (chuyển đổi năng lượng v&agrave; bơm nước):</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RPfddCCxlooNLZxyAAHlhkKXg6g\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng thay đổi ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DpGXdcLVGovUnVxqDszlX7f1gSf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh bắt đầu khi tấm <strong>pin mặt trời</strong><em><strong> </strong></em><em>(solar panel) </em>thu nhận &aacute;nh s&aacute;ng v&agrave; chuyển đổi n&oacute; th&agrave;nh năng lượng mặt trời.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Nhspd7eGgoKfVcxrL0Sldwcsg4f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Năng lượng n&agrave;y sau đ&oacute; được truyền tới <strong>một bộ chuyển đổi </strong><em>(converter)</em>, biến năng lượng mặt trời th&agrave;nh điện năng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tq3KdD4xvoyofmxh6zylx5uTgTd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Điện năng được tạo ra sẽ cung cấp cho m&aacute;y bơm được nối với <strong>giếng ngầm</strong> <em>(underground well)</em>, gi&uacute;p cho <strong>qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh h&uacute;t nước</strong> <em>(extraction of water) </em>từ dưới<strong> bề mặt đất</strong><em><strong> </strong></em><em>(ground surface).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\"><br>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: </strong><strong>Những bước sau trong qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh sản xuất nước (lọc v&agrave; ph&acirc;n phối nước):</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng thay đổi ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D0lxdXxw8oUNgJxAJgKlOaspgwe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Khi nước được <strong>bơm </strong><em>(is pumped up)</em> từ giếng ngầm l&ecirc;n, n&oacute; chảy v&agrave;o<strong> một bể chứa</strong><em> (water tank)</em> để <strong>chứa nước tạm thời</strong><em> (temporary storage).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KF8TdNlrsoMS4KxyPFplqskGgMf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Từ bể n&agrave;y, nước đi qua <strong>bộ lọc</strong><em> (water filter)</em> <strong>gắn tr&ecirc;n</strong><em> (mounted on)</em> một bệ gỗ, gi&uacute;p loại bỏ <strong>tạp chất </strong><em>(impurities)</em> v&agrave; c&aacute;c<strong> chất g&acirc;y &ocirc; nhiễm </strong><em>(contaminants)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KCgqdoCZzo6FhSx3kKYlTjj8grf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Nước uống đ&atilde; được lọc </strong><em>(filtered drinking water)</em> sẽ chảy ra qua v&ograve;i v&agrave; c&oacute; thể được hứng v&agrave;o <strong>c&aacute;c th&ugrave;ng chứa di động </strong><em>(moveable container) </em>để sử dụng v&agrave; ti&ecirc;u thụ.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1908,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WqOBdRMclojqnBxP2tklf23bgGb\">The diagram illustrates the process by which drinking water is produced using a solar-powered pumping and filtration system.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18720,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1909,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UrIOdfbI0oMerqxPiYLljZ99gfh\">Overall, this is a sustainable water production process that utilizes solar energy to extract groundwater and subsequently purify it through filtration. The system operates through two main phases: energy conversion and water pumping, followed by water treatment and distribution.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18720,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1910,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KJPqdLDpUoYYA8x5kPplo7Ykgod\">The process begins when the solar panel collects sunlight and converts it into solar energy. This energy is then transferred to a converter, which transforms solar power into electricity. The generated electricity powers a pump that is connected to an underground well, enabling the extraction of water from beneath the ground surface.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18720,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1911,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XlIRdFO4OoS8cexZdnQlsXpAgzf\">Once the water is pumped up from the underground well, it flows into a water tank for temporary storage. From the tank, the water passes through a water filter mounted on a wooden platform, which removes impurities and contaminants. Finally, the filtered drinking water is dispensed through a tap and can be collected in a moveable container for consumption and use.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18720,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
